    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just so exhausting to pretend otherwise. like i spend so much energy trying to act like i matter, but every single day it just feels like a lie. do you think it's actually more honest to just... stop pretending? to just embrace that nothingness instead of struggling against it?",
